{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id983357646"}, "name":{"label":"Tristan Robert"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-12T02:39:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13740658768"}, "title":{"label":"This is a paid subscription app"}, "content":{"label":"Some of you I’m sure already instinctively assumed this, after all that’s sort of the world we live in today. However, I was expecting to be able to use at least some basic features with ads. Unfortunately I’d have to warn you away from this app, your money is better spent towards getting a therapist or buying a bike or some running shoes man. If this is something your really struggling with I’d encourage you to talk to real people about it, and if you like the idea of an intimate software helping you out I must remind you that you can train AI to do literally everything this app has to offer, probably at a faster pace too, this option is free FYI. Sad to see there aren’t any developers left who are willing to take a pay cut in order to watch their brothers and sisters become stronger:( Hang in there fam, if you’ve come this far your already way ahead of the majority on track to liberation.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
