{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id738498704"}, "name":{"label":"369 is me"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-11T04:07:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13737352693"}, "title":{"label":"Needs work"}, "content":{"label":"It’s a cool app but there’s a a lot of things they need to fix. On the app blocker feature the app crashes literally every single time I try to block certain apps and if I try to specifically search a website to block the app crashes as well. It doesn’t let me use the full capacity of what the app should offer. There’s other things too but that one stands out to me", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1111608514"}, "name":{"label":"AfroPandaman1"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-11T00:04:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13736806462"}, "title":{"label":"SCAM WARNING: Billing Fraud / Impossible to Cancel"}, "content":{"label":"BEWARE: This app uses a fraudulent billing tactic to trap users. They direct you to an external website to sign up for a '3-day trial' via Apple Pay, which bypasses the official Apple Subscription settings. Once you sign up, the 'Unsubscribe' button inside the app is intentionally greyed out and broken. Because it is not a standard App Store subscription, you cannot cancel it through your iPhone settings. This is a predatory 'fleeceware' scam designed to steal recurring payments. Do not download, and do not provide any payment info", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1806991695"}, "name":{"label":"Haden94"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-10T12:33:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13735251667"}, "title":{"label":"Can’t access account"}, "content":{"label":"I purchased a year and cannot access my account through the app it keeps telling me me I have to buy the subscription again I’ve tired to activate my device and nothing happens and like everyone else is saying there is no customer support whatsoever", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id274731858"}, "name":{"label":"nickname12332192838"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-10T04:46:43-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13733896413"}, "title":{"label":"Impossible to cancel trial"}, "content":{"label":"I signed up for a free trial and wasn’t impressed, so I went to cancel. The subscription did not appear anywhere in my Apple subscriptions, which is where we’ve been trained to manage app payments.\n\nAfter signing up, I had received an email from a third-party payment processor (Link), so I followed the link in that email to manage or cancel. The subscription did not appear there either. I contacted Link directly and clearly asked to cancel before the trial ended.\n\nDespite this, I was charged for a full year of the app. I am now waiting on a refund while Link says they are “looking into this,” which has been going on for days.\n\nThe app itself may or may not be useful, but the billing and cancellation experience is confusing, non-transparent, and frustrating.  iPhone users should be very cautious, as this is not handled through Apple’s normal subscription system.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
