{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id41968283"}, "name":{"label":"DSWars"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-09T17:50:19-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13732454133"}, "title":{"label":"Just like a scam, requested a refund"}, "content":{"label":"Bought the lifetime and like many other reviewers it took my money and logged me out in seconds! When trying to log back in through Apple ID it brought me to the same new account page I was at originally. It then asked for a payment option again, you’re not getting me twice… what a joke!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1272758455"}, "name":{"label":"DK9908"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-09T17:38:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13732425139"}, "title":{"label":"Jesus flipped tables over the concept of this"}, "content":{"label":"I had seen many ads for this app and wanted to check it out. I found it extremely odd that the ads were of influencers who gave great messages about getting out of sin and lust, just to get people to download this app and…pay a subscription. I couldn’t help but feel that it was a way to take advantage and make money off of those struggling with addiction. But I paid the $50 for the lifetime subscription (which was labeled as a limited time deal and said the regular price for this was $450), and tried checking out the app and its features for no longer than two minutes before I was kicked back to the welcome screen and couldn’t get back in without paying for the subscription AGAIN. I tried reloading the app, looking for a way to skip the page, but nothing worked. Whether this was a glitch or a way for them to try and make more money, I feel like charging our brothers and sisters in Christ for help that should be freely given by God’s people is exactly the kind of thing that got people’s tables flipped in the table by Jesus Himself.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id635947907"}, "name":{"label":"JMH2000halo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-09T12:05:17-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"172"}, "id":{"label":"13731621105"}, "title":{"label":"Charged Twice and can’t access"}, "content":{"label":"I tried to log in for the first time, purchased the “lifetime” subscription, and it said there was an error and then logged me out. I tried logging back in but it called for another payment. So I paid and then it said there was an error and then logged me out again. Then I got charged twice and now it says my account doesn’t exist because I can’t log in. I tried to get a refund through Apple Services but got denied. I got scammed. And QUITTR services just points you to Apple Services instead of taking responsibility. 😢", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6532588521&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
